	<section_number>46.2-822</section_number>
	<catch_line>Right-of-way at circular intersections</catch_line>
	<text>
		At circular intersections, vehicles already in the circle shall have the right-of-way over vehicles approaching and entering the circle, unless otherwise directed by traffic control devices.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-238; 1952, c. 666; 1956, c. 533; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-221; 1985, c. 218; 1989, c. 727; 2013, cc. 128, 400.</history>
